      "description": "A giant praying mantis with a purplish red body and a pair of sharp scythe-like arms. The monster's vibrant color gives it a false impression that it covers itself in blood, thereby giving it its gruesome name. But, the monster holds well to its name with how it is known to attack villages when prey is sparse. They are known to be very predatory, even among praying mantis type monsters."
